    "body": "@amok\r\n> when access to the actual shell's env is essential\r\n\r\nCustom commands always run in a child process of starship, the choice of shell should make no difference. In your particular case, you might also be able to use an `env_var` module.\r\n\r\n> Is there a chance of introducing a native plugin system?\r\n\r\nI expect something like that to be implemented at some point.",
